  "description": "Grunge golden of phase3.2_proc-grunge-families (diagnostic): grunge cases on the authored 20 cm plane (UVs 0..1, one tile), texture set 2048 px, no bake. Each case is a white Raw fill on its own L32F User channel, over a black base fill, under a black mask holding a fill effect whose source is the grunge, at the fill's default UV projection: User0 linen-seed-1: resource://starter_assets/fabric_linen/fabric_linen?version=7fa9d3720c64d4a797642fc3933c271befe7c247.sbsar ($randomseed = 1). The User maps are exported as OpenEXR 32f, padding passthrough, no dithering; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen).",
